1361 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 845 0 R
/E (Frosh is an event with drinking, not a drinking event! Drinking is opt-in, always. Although alcohol is present at frosh, it is never the main focus. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1362 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 845 0 R
/E (Not everyone is comfortable with drinking games, so we try to make sure that games are inclusive of non-drinkers and do not put pressure on anyone to consume alcohol.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1363 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 845 0 R
