>>
endobj
1365 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 846 0 R
/E (It is also your responsibility to ensure you create an environment throughout frosh that promotes respect, tolerance and community. Everyone deserves respect, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, sexual orientation, or religious affiliation... And everyone deserves the same amount of respect whether it be staff, leader, froshie, or coord. While people may differ in opinions and disagree, that is no reason to be disrespectful or hurtful. Remember, frosh is a fun and positive community-building event with no room for negativity or disrespect. It would be best if you mentioned everything outlined above during your group introduction to establish a good group dynamic right off the bat.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1366 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 847 0 R
/T (SEXUAL CONSENT AND BEING AN ACTIVE BYSTANDER:)
/E (SEXUAL CONSENT AND BEING AN ACTIVE BYSTANDER:)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
1367 0 obj
